        <span class="section__badge">Booking</span>
        <h2 class="section__h2">Let your customers book themselves</h2>
        <p class="section__sub">No phone calls. No back-and-forth. Customers pick a service, choose a slot, and get an instant confirmation — any time of day, from any device.</p>
