            <div class="fp-feat">
              <h3 class="fp-feat__title">24/7 Self-Booking</h3>
              <p class="fp-feat__desc">Customers book without calling. You capture revenue while you sleep.</p>
            </div>
            <div class="fp-feat">
              <h3 class="fp-feat__title">Zero Double-Bookings</h3>
              <p class="fp-feat__desc">Real-time slot locking means two clients can never land on the same therapist at the same time.</p>
