                <div class="eod-row eod-row--2"><span class="eod-type">Card</span><span class="eod-amt">$2,340</span><span class="eod-check">✓</span></div>
                <div class="eod-row eod-row--3"><span class="eod-type">Online</span><span class="eod-amt">$760</span><span class="eod-check">✓</span></div>
                <div class="eod-total">Total: $3,940</div>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="entr-row__text">
          <div class="fp-feats">
            <div class="fp-feat">
              <h3 class="fp-feat__title">Daily Revenue Close</h3>
              <p class="fp-feat__desc">One click to close the day. Gross revenue, net revenue, discounts, and booking counts — auto-calculated and locked.</p>
            </div>
            <div class="fp-feat">
              <h3 class="fp-feat__title">Payment Mode Breakdown</h3>
              <p class="fp-feat__desc">See exactly how much came in as cash, card, or online transfer. Reconcile by mode in seconds.</p>
            </div>
            <div class="fp-feat">
              <h3 class="fp-feat__title">Full Audit Trail</h3>
              <p class="fp-feat__desc">Every discount, payment edit, and status change is logged with a timestamp and the user who made it.</p>
            </div>
            <div class="fp-feat">
              <h3 class="fp-feat__title">Day-End Lock</h3>
              <p class="fp-feat__desc">Once the day is closed, it's frozen. No edits, no backdating — financial records stay clean and tamper-proof.</p>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>

      </div>

